/* Which agent is the bottleneck? Duration by sub-agent, fleet-wide.
   Only possible because each specialist is its own OTel service inside
   one trace. serviceName is a top-level span field — no attributes needed.

   Expected (1,000 runs per service, both releases):
     remediation-orchestrator  avg ~336 ms   (end to end)
     diagnosis-agent           avg ~238 ms   <- ~71% of time-to-remediation
     remediation-agent         avg  ~52 ms
     comms-agent               avg  ~40 ms
   WALL-CLOCK, like 02 — claim the ~71% share, not the millisecond. */
source = otel-v1-apm-span-*
| where name like 'agent.run%' or name = 'incident.remediate'
| eval duration_ms = durationInNanos / 1000000
| stats count() as runs,
        avg(duration_ms) as avg_ms,
        percentile(duration_ms, 95) as p95_ms
  by serviceName
| sort - avg_ms
